OL,3,GNEWSA'Burnt out car' and 'bridge blown
OL,4,Aup for TV show'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly roundup of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FWiltshire Times reported on a burnt out
OL,11,Fcar discovered in woods near Longleat
OL,12,FSafari Park. The vehicle was found by a
OL,13,Fdog walker in Cannimore Woods on 6
OL,14,FSeptember and locals said it was
OL,15,F"incredibly lucky" that the fire did
OL,16,Fnot spread.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
