OL,3,GNEWSA'Burnt out car' and 'bridge blown
OL,4,Aup for TV show'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA kebab shop in Swindon has been fined
OL,7,F#40,000 for hiring workers illegally.
OL,8,FThe Swindon Advertiser reported that
OL,9,Fthe Brazilian restaurant Recanto in
OL,10,FCommercial Road was visited by the Home
OL,11,FOffice recently.
OL,13,FGloucestershire Live reported on the
OL,14,F"outcry" over plans for a new cycle
OL,15,Fpath in Gloucester. Residents said the
OL,16,Fstretch near the Oval - part of a
OL,17,F26-mile route from Bishops Cleeve near
OL,18,FCheltenham to Stroud - was "crazy" and
OL,19,Fwould create road safety hazards and
OL,20,Fparking problems.
